 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Change Manufacturing Bill of Material for Production (3LO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item covers the change-master-controlled updates of a Manufacturing BOM that is used for the production process of components.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The change-number-controlled approach allows date-effectivity-based attributes management on the Manufacturing BOM (MBOM) header level and the Bill of Materials (BOM) items level. Setting the change number status to inactive releases the scope per change number. Once the status becomes inactive, changes are no longer possible. The MBOM header and items can only be changed with a new active change number. The change iteration process starts and ends again with setting the change number status to inactive.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The change-number-controlled update process is followed by the production process which uses the recently updated MBOM.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Change change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Exchange a material or component in MBOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create production order manually</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Control updates in bill of materials for production centrally with change master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage effective changed day in change master</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>更改生产的制造物料清单 (3LO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目涵盖用于组件生产流程的制造物料清单的变更主数据控制的更新。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">变更编号控制的方法允许在制造物料清单 (MBOM) 抬头级别和物料清单 (BOM) 项目级别基于日期有效性的属性管理。将变更编号状态设置为非活动会释放每个变更编号的范围。状态变为非活动后，无法再进行更改。只能使用新的活动更改编号更改制造物料清单抬头和项目。变更编号状态设置为非活动后，变更迭代流程将再次开始和结束。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">变更编号控制的更新流程后跟使用最近更新的 MBOM 的生产流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建变更主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更改更改主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">交换 MBOM 中的物料或组件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">手动创建生产订单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioecb4934053f946ec80800fc2b8a25c24__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过变更主数据，集中控制生产物料清单中的更新</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理变更主数据的有效变更日</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
